{"id":330,"name":"flygon","speciesId":330,"dex":330,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["ground","dragon"],"stats":{"hp":80,"attack":100,"defense":80,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":80,"speed":100},"abilities":[{"name":"levitate","hidden":false}],"height":20,"weight":820,"baseExp":234,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/330.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/330.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/330.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/330.ogg","genus":"Mystic Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Místico","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"FLYGON is nicknamed “the elemental spirit of the desert.” Because its flapping wings whip up a cloud of sand, this POKéMON is always enveloped in a sandstorm while flying."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"FLYGON whips up a sandstorm by flapping its wings. The wings create a series of notes that sound like singing. Because the “singing” is the only thing that can be heard in a sandstorm, this POKéMON is said to be the desert spirit."},{"version":"emerald","text":"The flapping of its wings sounds like singing. To prevent detection by enemies, it hides itself by flapping up a cloud of desert sand."},{"version":"firered","text":"It hides itself by kicking up desert sand with its wings. Red covers shield its eyes from sand."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It whips up sandstorms with powerful flaps of its wings. It is known as “The Desert Spirit.”"},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It is nicknamed “The Desert Spirit” because the flapping of its wings sounds like a woman singing."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Known as “The Desert Spirit,” this Pokémon hides in the sandstorms it causes by beating its wings."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Flygon is nicknamed “the elemental spiri